# Trivy misconfiguration IDs to accept. Each entry needs a justification and an
# expiry date (exp:YYYY-MM-DD) so it gets revisited.

# Node security group egress 0.0.0.0/0 (terraform-aws-modules/eks "egress_all").
# Nodes reach ECR, STS, EKS, GitHub and Helm repos through NAT, and with Cilium
# ENI mode pod traffic leaves through the same security group, so a narrower
# rule would break pods. Pod egress is enforced by Cilium/Kubernetes
# NetworkPolicies (default-deny in tenant namespaces). Tracked as known gap 10
# (no egress domain allow-listing) in docs/security-controls.md.
AWS-0104 exp:2027-04-30
